# npm pack exclusions. This file exists for ONE divergence from .gitignore:
# the CI-committed tray-launcher binaries (bin/rust-launcher/*) must ship in
# the release bundles but NOT in the npm tarball — nothing in the npm code
# path (cli-boot-wrapper.js, src/**) ever spawns them, and the four of them
# add ~20MB to every `npm i mstream`. npm only consults .gitignore when no
# .npmignore exists, so everything below must stay a mirror of .gitignore
# (minus the launcher negations); if you change one file, change the other.
# The rust-parser negations are load-bearing: the npm server DOES spawn
# it at runtime. (mstream-player and the p2p sidecar are fetched on first
# use instead — only their pin manifests ship.)

node_modules/*
# build-bun.yml installs the VersionInfo stamper (resedit) here on the win-x64 leg
scripts/node_modules/
webapp/node_modules/*

image-cache/*
!image-cache/README.md

save/sync/*
!save/sync/README.md

save/logs/*
!save/logs/README.md

save/conf/*
!save/conf/README.md

save/sync-cdn/*
!save/sync-cdn/README.md

bin/ffmpeg/*
!bin/ffmpeg/README.md

bin/rust-parser/*
!bin/rust-parser/README.md
!bin/rust-parser/rust-parser-*
!bin/rust-parser/.source-tree
!bin/rust-parser/.source-tree-musl

# The whole launcher directory stays out of the tarball (binaries AND the
# CI provenance stamp) — release bundles get them via scripts/build-bun.mjs.
bin/rust-launcher/

# mstream-player binaries are fetched on first use from the player repo's
# release assets, sha256-pinned by the committed manifest — only the pins
# and the README ship in the tarball.
bin/mstream-player/*
!bin/mstream-player/README.md
!bin/mstream-player/manifest.json

# p2p-sidecar binaries are fetched on first use from the sidecar repo's
# release assets, sha256-pinned by the committed manifests below — they must
# never ride the npm tarball again (they were 179 MB of its 284 MB unpacked,
# for a default-off feature). The manifests DO ship: they're what the fetch
# verifies against.
bin/p2p-sidecar/*
!bin/p2p-sidecar/README.md
!bin/p2p-sidecar/manifest.json
!bin/p2p-sidecar/manifest-musl.json

save/*.json

.DS_Store
.vscode/*

*.log
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.migrated-from-loki
.instance-nonce
frp/*.ini

dist/*
webapp/dist/*

bun.lock

.env

rust-parser/target/
rust-launcher/target/
# Nested sidecar-repo clone (dev loop) — never ships in the tarball.
# Anchored: unanchored it would also swallow bin/p2p-sidecar/'s manifests
# (same pitfall as .gitignore — see there).
/p2p-sidecar/
/mstream-terminal-player/

save/waveforms/*
!save/waveforms/README.md

waveform-cache/*
!waveform-cache/README.md

test/fixtures/music/

save/library-*/
save/db-*-smoke/
save/image-cache-*-smoke/
save/waveform-cache-*-smoke/
save/logs-*-smoke/
save/image-cache-smoke/
save/waveform-cache-smoke/

.claude/*

/TODO.md

docs/api.html
model-cache/

.*.bun-build
